| Innovation, 30% | 6/10 | 18/30 | The strongest distinction is the chain from checked quotation to recorded decision and version, underplayed beneath the helpers on slides 4 to 6. Slide 11 overclaims what chat cannot do. Which demonstrated action actually invokes AI, and which uses fixtures or deterministic code? Slides 5, 9 and 11 do not settle this. |
